    Lines:
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: "Indigo from the river dyers, every bolt of it. Ten summers in the sun and it still won't fade."
      - Speaker: ""
        Text: "A shrine maiden's hakama wants a good red. Mine are all blue, I'm afraid. Blue sells."
